<title>FINLAND: ARSENAL SAYS SELLS REAL ESTATE TO POSTIPANKKI.</title>
<headline>ARSENAL SAYS SELLS REAL ESTATE TO POSTIPANKKI.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned asset management company Arsenal Oy said in a statement on Monday it had sold a bank office property in the city of Oulu to state-owned bank group Postipankki Oy for 48.2 million markka.</p>
<p>Postipankki has been a lease holder in the Kirkkokatu 13 real estate until now, it said.</p>
<p>Arsenal said it had sold real estate worth almost 300 million markka in the first two months of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
